  "status": "present",
  "value": "sort the durations and keep the slot end times in a min-heap of size min(n * m, number of tasks); pop the earliest, stop when it plus the duration exceeds 60, otherwise push the new end time. Complexity target: O(t log t) time/O(t) space, t = number of tasks.",
